publicQuestions.question:
Previous housing engagement

Has Council undertaken any recent community, stakeholder or industry engagement specifically relating to housing needs, housing supply, housing diversity, affordability or barriers to residential development within the Cassowary Coast Region? If so, could Council please identify the relevant engagement activities and advise whether the findings, consultation records or reports will be made available to the successful consultant?

Existing stakeholder relationships

Does Council maintain an existing stakeholder database, reference group or established relationships with organisations that are expected to be engaged through this project, including community organisations, development industry representatives, housing and homelessness service providers, community housing providers, major employers and relevant State Government agencies? If so, will Council facilitate introductions and/or provide appropriate stakeholder contact information to the successful consultant?

First Nations engagement protocols

Does Council have established relationships, engagement protocols or existing consultation arrangements with Traditional Owners, First Nations organisations, Prescribed Bodies Corporate, Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander community organisations or other relevant First Nations representatives within the Cassowary Coast Region that should be followed for this project?

First Nations engagement responsibilities

